[[File:DT534-RebuildingTheResistance.jpg|thumb|right|200px|A locker bearing the designation DT534]]
'''DT534''' was a designation used by the [[First Order]] by the time of the [[First Order-Resistance War]]. The [[First Order barracks]] on the [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|''Resurgent''-class Star Destroyer]]<ref name="Into the Unknown">{{Resistance|Into the Unknown}}</ref> ''[[Thunderer]]''<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> had a locker bearing the designation.<ref name="Into the Unknown" /> In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="34 ABY">{{ResistanceDate|2|1}}</ref> the [[Technician|mechanic]] [[Tamara Ryvora]] joined the First Order as a [[cadet]], taking on the designation DT-533. As such, the cadet's locker was located directly to the left of the one marked for DT534.<ref name="Into the Unknown" />

==Behind the scenes==
DT534 debuted on a locker in "[[Into the Unknown]],"<ref name="Into the Unknown" /> the first episode of the [[Star Wars Resistance Season Two|second season]] of the animated television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', which aired on [[October 6]], [[2019]].<ref name="Disney release">{{DisneyPress|wdtv=1|url=disneychannel/shows/star-wars-resistance/episodes|text=Star Wars Resistance}}</ref> [[Lucasfilm Animation]] artist [[Aaron Pham]] created concept artwork featuring the locker and its designation dated to [[December 5]], [[2017]].<ref name="ConceptArt">{{SW|url=into-the-unknown-episode-concept-art-gallery|text="Into the Unknown" Episode Concept Art Gallery}} {{C|Slide 11}}</ref> Prior to the episode's release, a clip from "Into the Unknown" showing the designation was included "[[Path of Resistance]]"<ref name="Path">{{HomeVideoCite|set=Star Wars Resistance: Complete Season One|italics=1|featurette=Path of Resistance}}</ref> featurette included in the DVD ''[[Star Wars Resistance: Complete Season One]]'', which was released on [[August 20]], 2019.<ref name="DVD">{{SW|url=news/star-wars-resistance-season-one-dvd|text=''Star Wars Resistance'' Season One Coming to DVD on August 20|date=2019-07-23}}</ref>

